#: ../../source/docs/sport-mode.rst:5 cbce036c7d2247a2aae25890b2ebfde5
msgid "Sport Mode"
msgstr "Sport 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/sport-mode.rst:7 2560c46495864d3ea1b65d4a2877a75f
msgid ""
"Sport Mode is also known as \"rate controlled stabilize\" plus Altitude "
"Hold."
msgstr "Sport 模式也被称为\"速率控制自稳\"加高度保持。"

#: ../../source/docs/sport-mode.rst:10 b2434c8e028a4a9d98a71f0d9c148cbd
msgid ""
"this mode is not included by default in the firmware built and available on "
"the `Firmware Server <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ . Either the user "
"must build his own firmware with this mode enabled or use the `Custom "
"Firmware Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__"
msgstr ""
"此模式不包含在 `固件服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ "
"上构建和提供的默认固件中。用户需要自行构建启用了此模式的固件，或使用 `自定义固件服务器 "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/sport-mode.rst:13 83760e00e24d492aa563f9ce51d71108
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/sport-mode.rst:15 a594f5b63eaa4ac4b3437fbc52ba15ce
msgid ""
"It was designed to be useful for flying FPV and filming `dolly shots "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dolly_shot>`__ or fly bys because you can set"
" the vehicle at a particular angle and it will maintain that angle."
msgstr ""
"该模式设计用于 FPV 飞行和拍摄 `移动镜头 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dolly_shot>`__ "
"（即跟踪拍摄）或飞越拍摄，因为您可以将飞行器固定在特定角度并保持该角度不变。"

#: ../../source/docs/sport-mode.rst:18 b7fcbcfb192245bd8732eb24b11ec196
msgid ""
"The pilot's roll, pitch and yaw sticks control the rate of rotation of the "
"vehicle so when the sticks are released the vehicle will remain in its "
"current attitude."
msgstr "飞手的横滚、俯仰和偏航摇杆控制飞行器的旋转速率，因此当摇杆释放时，飞行器将保持当前姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/sport-mode.rst:21 d81b8ce96c814728abc4e4016d41a3a0
msgid ""
"The vehicle will not lean more than 30 degrees (this angle is adjustable "
"with the :ref:`ATC_ANGLE_MAX<ATC_ANGLE_MAX>` parameter)"
msgstr "飞行器倾斜角不会超过 30 度（此角度可通过 :ref:`ATC_ANGLE_MAX<ATC_ANGLE_MAX>` 参数调整）"

#: ../../source/docs/sport-mode.rst:23 8710fb421a4f43938e84b2691cd9c0cf
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The altitude is maintained with the altitude hold controller so the vehicle "
"will attempt to hold its current altitude when the sticks are within the "
"mid-throttle deadzone, which is adjustable with :ref:`THR_DZ<THR_DZ>`. It "
"will climb or descend at up to 2.5m/s (this speed is adjustable with the "
":ref:`PILOT_SPD_UP<PILOT_SPD_UP>` and :ref:`PILOT_SPD_DN<PILOT_SPD_DN>` "
"parameters). The acceleration used to establish these speeds is set by "
":ref:`PILOT_ACC_Z<PILOT_ACC_Z>`."
msgstr ""
"高度由定高控制器维持：当摇杆处于中位油门死区（可通过 :ref:`THR_DZ<THR_DZ>` 调整）内时，飞行器将尝试保持当前高度。飞行器最高可以 "
"2.5m/s 的速度爬升或下降（此速度可通过 :ref:`PILOT_SPD_UP<PILOT_SPD_UP>` 和 "
":ref:`PILOT_SPD_DN<PILOT_SPD_DN>` 参数调整）。达到这些速度所用的加速度由 "
":ref:`PILOT_ACC_Z<PILOT_ACC_Z>` 设定。"
